2 CONT The first official record we have of our direct Drouillard line is the marriage of Jean Drouillard and Jeanne Chevreau, August 30, 1666 at Marennes, diocese of Saintes, Saintonge, France.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marennes is on the seacoast in Southern France near the port of Bordeaux. Witnesses at the marriage were Pierre Mercier, Jean Drouillard, Etienne Drouillard and Michel Baudet. 
2 CONT
