2 CONT http://yelnam.tripod.com/Drouillard.html
2 CONT
2 CONT Simon Argentcour DROUILLARD (Jean) was born on 16 Mar 1667/1668 in Marenne, FRANCE. He died on 21 Oct 1733 in Detroit, Wayne, Michigan, USA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Simon married Marguerite FERRE, daughter of Pierre FERRE and Marie Marguerite LASNON, on 25 Nov 1698 in Notre Dame, Quebec, CANADA. Marguerite was born on 7 Mar 1679/1680 in Quebec, CANADA. She died on 12 Sep 1711 in Quebec, CANAD
2 CONC A.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following child:
2 CONT
2 CONT + 3 M i. Jean Baptiste DROUILLARD was born on 14 Feb 1706/1707 and died in 1756.
2 CONT
2 CONT Simon Drouillard dit Argentcourt is married at Quebec, November 25. 1698, to seventeen year old Margaret Ferret, the eleventh of thirteen children of Peter Ferret and Marie Lasnon (3.). Simon and Margaret had one child born at Rep
2 CONC entigny, Province of Quebec. Three more children were baptized at St. Francis, Isle Orleans.
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret Drouillard wife of Simon dit Argentcourt Drouillard died in 1711 at the early age of just thirty.
2 CONT
