1 NOTE {geni:about_me}  CHARLES (3) CARRIER was born on 8 May 1712 in Quebec City, P. Q.. He died in Jun 1780. He was buried on 25 Jun 1780 in Quebec City, P. Q.. Parents: IGNACE-PHILIPPE CARRIER and CATHERINE-ROSALIE DUQUET .
2 CONT
2 CONT He was married to CATHERINE DROUILLARD on 7 Jan 1738 in Lauzon, Levis, P. Q.. Children were: Marie-Catherine CARRIER, Jean-Baptiste CARRIER , Charles CARRIER, Marie-Madeleine CARRIER, Simon CARRIER, Ignace CARRIER, Pierre-Augustin
2 CONC  CARRIER, FRANCOIS CARRIER, Gabriel CARRIER, Marie-Josephte CARRIER, Joseph (06) CARRIER .
