1 NOTE Married 31 Jan 1695 Pierre Joseph Feret (son of Pierre & Marie Lasnon; bap 17 Aug 1670 at Quebec; died bef 1696) at St Francois de Sales, Neuville, Portneuf, Quebec, Canada; sources: Tanguay Vol I pg 82; (c. 24 Roger); family (1 c
2 CONC hild) listed in Jette pg 416 & Tanguay Vol I pg 230; marriage record in LDS film #1290462; Boutin genealogy page (copy filed 36-6).
2 CONT Remarried 6 Jul 1699 Francois Badeau (son of Jean & Marguerite Chalifour; bap 2 June 1675 at Ste Famille) at Quebec, Quebec, Canada; sources: (c. 05 Roger); family (6 children) listed in Jette pg 40 & Tanguay Vol I pg 21; Tanguay 
2 CONC Vol I pg 82.
2 CONT Gordon genealogy from the internet (copy filed 36-6).
2 CONT "The Grand Families" from the internet (copy filed 36-6).
2 CONT See History in the Jean Boutin (#1102) message lines.
2 CONT Boutin genealogy page (copy filed 36-6).
2 CONT -------------------------------------------------
2 CONT The following was acquired from:  <http://www.fortlangley.ca/pepin/056_jgboutin/pafg03.htm#125>.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie-Françoise BOUTIN (Antoine , Jean ) was christened on 21 May 1673. was buried on 5 Sep 1745.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie-Françoise married (1) II-- Pierre-Joseph FERRÉ, son of Pierre FERRÉ and Marie LASNON, on 31 Jan 1695 in Pointe-aux-Trembles de Québec. Pierre-Joseph was christened on 17 Aug 1670. He was buried before 1696.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT F i Marie-Louise FERRÉ was christened on 15 Feb 1696. was buried on 20 May 1744.
2 CONT Marie-Louise married (1) II-- Sebastien GINGRAS, son of Sébastien GINGRAS and Marie-Geneviève GUILLEBOUT, on 8 Jan 1720 in Québec. Sebastien was christened in 1679. He was buried on 2 May 1722.
2 CONT Marie-Louise also married (2) Toussaint DUMAREUIL on 11 Sep 1730.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie-Françoise also married (2) III-- François BADEAU, son of Jean BADEAU and Marguerite CHALIFOUR, on 6 Jul 1699 in Québec. François was christened on 2 Jun 1675.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT F ii Marie-Elizabeth BADEAU was christened on 11 Jul 1700. was buried on 4 Jun 1724.
2 CONT Marie-Elizabeth married I-- Jean VERNIER aka Goarville, son of Jean VERNIER and Françoise HÉRAUT, on 7 Jan 1721 in Québec. Jean was christened in 1695.
2 CONT M iii François-Pierre BADEAU was christened on 27 Jun 1702. was buried on 5 Sep 1703.
2 CONT + F iv Marie-Jeanne BADEAU was christened on 19 Jan 1704 and was buried on 21 Aug 1781.
2 CONT F v Thérèse BADEAU was christened on 16 Oct 1706. was buried on 18 Oct 1706.
2 CONT M vi François-Marie BADEAU  was christened on 28 Jul 1709. was buried on 9 Feb 1715.
2 CONT F vii Marie-Charlotte BADEAU was christened on 19 Jun 1713. was buried on 5 Feb 1717.
2 CONT --------------------------------------------------
