2 CONT Brief Life History of Jean
2 CONT
2 CONT When Jean de Rome was born on 10 December 1678, in Quebec City, Québec, Canada, New France, his father, Denys de Rome, was 55 and his mother, Jacqueline Roulois, was 35. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie Ferré on 1 February 1706, in Quebec City, Québec, Canada, New France. They were the parents of at least 3 sons. 
2 CONT Jean Jacques Derome 1707–1707
2 CONT Jean Baptiste de Rome 1708–
2 CONT Joseph Derome 1710-1786
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 15 June 1711, in his hometown, at the age of 32.
