2 CONT Brief Life History of Jean Baptiste'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Jean Baptiste de Rome was born on 3 May 1708, in Quebec City, Québec, Canada, New France, his father, Jean de Rome, was 29 and his mother, Marie Ferré, was 32. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married 1st wife Marie Susanne Jeane (1712-1754) on 16 September 1732, in Quebec City, Québec, Canada, New France. They were the parents of at least 6 sons and 3 daughters.
2 CONT Jean Baptiste Derome 1734–
2 CONT Marie Susanne Derome 1735–1821
2 CONT Pierre Charles Derome  Descareaux 1738–1764
2 CONT George Derome 1740–1809
2 CONT Marie Louise Derome Descareau (1) 1743–1743
2 CONT Marie Louise Derome Descareau (2) 1745–1787
2 CONT Joseph Marie Derome 1747–1748 (died in infancy)
2 CONT Joseph de Rome 1749–1798
2 CONT Francois Xavier Derome Décareau 1752–1755 (died in infancy)
2 CONT
2 CONT He married 2nd wife Marie Madeleine Hunault (1731–1797)
2 CONT on 14 avril 1755 in Notre-Dame-de-Québec, Québec, Québec, Canada, Nouvelle-France
2 CONT They had at least 11 children
