2 CONT Brief Life History of Joseph
2 CONT
2 CONT When Joseph Derome was born on 1 March 1710, in La Cité-Limoilou, Quebec City, Quebec, Canada, his father, Jean de Rome, was 31 and his mother, Marie Ferré, was 34. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie Angelique Victoire Filiau on 1 September 1732, in Notre-Dame de Québec, Quebec City, Québec, Canada, New France. They were the parents of at least 8 sons and 5 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 12 June 1786, in Sainte-Anne-de-Beaupré, District Judiciaire de Québec, Quebec, British North America, at the age of 76.
