1 NAME George Drouillard, Lewis & Clark Exped.
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 PLAC Detroit
2 ADDR
1 BIRT
2 DATE 27 SEP 1775
2 ADDR
3 CITY Detroit River Region
3 CTRY (present USA)
