2 CONC a 1712-1780; Louis, circa 1715-1801; Rose, circa 1716-1790; Marie Louise, 1718; Joseph Marie, 1722-1722; Marie Marguerite, 1723-1723; Joseph, 1725-1725; Marie Suzanne, 1727-XXXX; Marie Genevieve, 1730-1730; and Joseph Marie,1732-1
