1 NOTE {geni:about_me} IGNACE-PHILIPPE CARRIER was born on 5 Sep 1671 in Quebec City, P. Q.. He was baptized on 7 Sep 1671 in Quebec City, P. Q.. He died on 22 Aug 1765 in Lauzon, Levis, P. Q.. He was buried on 23 Aug 1765 in St. Joseph 
2 CONC de La Pointe de Levis, P. Q.. He was also known as IGNACE & IGNACE-PHILIPPE CARROER. Ignace-Philippe Carrier was married twice. He had at least 8 children with his first wife, Perinne-Genevieve Grenet. Ignace-Philippe had at least
2 CONC  2 children with his second wife Catherine-Rosalie Duquet. Children with Perinne: 1. Joseph Sr., 2. Francoise, 3. Augustin, 4. Catherine, 5. Marie, 6. Louise, and 7. Ignace Jr., & 8. Elisabeth. IGNACE-PHILIPPE had at least 4 child
2 CONC ren with his second wife, CATHERINE-ROSALIE DUQUET. Their son CHARLES, of the second marriage directly relates to this genealogy. His children with Catherine-Rosalie Duquet were Marie-Louise, CHARLES, Jean-Baptiste, and Louis. Par
2 CONC ents: JEAN CARRIER and BARBE HALAY.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was married to Perrine GRENET on 16 Jun 1693 in St. Joseph de La Pointe de Levis, P. Q.. Children were: Ignace CARRIER, Louise CARRIER, Joseph (01) CARRIER, Marie-Jeanne CARRIER, Marie CARRIER, Catherine CARRIER, Marie-Elisabet
2 CONC h CARRIER, Francoise CARRIER, Augustin CARRIER, Jean-Baptiste CARRIER.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was married to CATHERINE-ROSALIE DUQUET on 2 Jun 1710 in St. Joseph de La Pointe de Levis, P. Q.. Children were: Jean-Baptiste CARRIER, CHARLES (3) CARRIER, Marie-Rose CARRIER, Louis CARRIER, Marie-Louise CARRIER, Marie-Josepht
2 CONC e CARRIER, Marie-Marguerite CARRIER , Joseph CARRIER, Marie-Suzanne CARRIER, Marie-Genevieve CARRIER, Joseph-Marie CARRIER.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Born on September 5, 1671 in Notre Dame de Quebec, Quebec City, Quebec, Canada. (See Note 1) Married his second wife Catherine Rosalie Duquet on June 2, 1710 in Lauzon, Levis, Quebec, Canada.. Had eleven children JEAN BAPTISTE bor
2 CONC n in 1711; Charles, circa 1712-1780; Louis circa 1715-1801; Rose, circa  1716-1790; Marie Louise, 1718-1786; Joseph Marie 1722-1722; Marie Marguerite, 1723-1723; Joseph, 1725-1725; Marie Suzanne, 1727-XXXX; Marie Genevieve, 1730-1
2 CONC 730 and Joseph Marie, 1732-1781. (See Note 3) . Ignace died on August 22, 1765 in Lauzon.. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Source:
2 CONT
2 CONT Beth W. Davies
2 CONT
2 CONT American Fork, Utah
2 CONT
2 CONT April 2008
2 CONT
2 CONT Research Notes:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.Married his first wife Perrine Genevieve Grenet on June 16,1693 in Lauzon, Quebec, Canada. Perrine was born on September 15,1672 in Notre Dame de Quebec and died in Lauzon on September 16, 1709. They had eleven children Ignace 1
2 CONC 694-1765; Louise, 1695-1728; Joseph, 1697-1765; Marie Jeanne, 1698-1703; Marie,1700-1762; Elisabeth, 1702-1737 and her twin Catherine, 1702-1791; Joseph, 1704-1704; Francoise, 1706-1772; and Augustin, 1709-1757 and his twin Jean B
2 CONC aptiste,1709-1709. A Family Group Record was not prepared for this family.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.Perrine's parents were Francois Grenet and Marie du Coudray both of whom were born in France. They were married on September 15, 1670 in Quebec,City, Quebec, Canada. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. With respect to children of Ignace's second marriage, unable to locate Baptism record for Charles, Louis and Rose. Rose was possibly older that Louis. Unable to locate death record of Marie Suzanne. Marie Suzanne married a mili
2 CONC tary surgeon and the couple might have returned to France. Joseph Marie born in 1732 never married.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT IGNACE-PHILIPPE CARRIER was born on 5 Sep 1671 in Quebec City, P. Q.. He was baptized on 7 Sep 1671 in Quebec City, P. Q.. He died on 22 Aug 1765 in Lauzon, Levis, P. Q.. He was buried on 23 Aug 1765 in St. Joseph de La Pointe de 
2 CONC Levis, P. Q.. He was also known as IGNACE & IGNACE-PHILIPPE CARROER. Ignace-Philippe Carrier was married twice. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He had at least 8 children with his first wife, Perinne-Genevieve Grenet. Ignace-Philippe had at least 2 children with his second wife Catherine-Rosalie Duquet. Children with Perinne: 1. Joseph Sr., 2. Francoise, 3. Augustin, 4. C
2 CONC atherine, 5. Marie, 6. Louise, and 7. Ignace Jr., & 8. Elisabeth. IGNACE-PHILIPPE had at least 4 children with his second wife, CATHERINE-ROSALIE DUQUET. Their son CHARLES, of the second marriage directly relates to this genealogy
2 CONC . His children with Catherine-Rosalie Duquet were Marie-Louise, CHARLES, Jean-Baptiste, and Louis. Parents: JEAN CARRIER and BARBE HALAY.
2 CONT
