1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/K4D3-M6D
2 CONT Brief Life History of Josephte Rosalie'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Josephte Rosalie Titley was born on 5 September 1785, in Soulanges, Montreal, Quebec, British North America, her father, Martin Titley, was 36 and her mother, Marie Reine Langlois, was 18. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Gabriel Carrier on 18 November 1805, in Saint-Michel, Vaudreuil, Lower Canada, British North America. They were the parents of at least 2 sons and 1 daughter. 
2 CONT Marie Rose Carriere 1806–1807
2 CONT Louis Benjamin Carriere 1808–
2 CONT Marcier Carriere 1808–
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 23 October 1832, in Hawkesbury, Prescott and Russell, Canada West, British North America, at the age of 47, and was buried in Sainte-Madeleine-de-Rigaud, Lower Canada, British North America.
