2 CONT Brief Life History of Jean Baptiste
2 CONT
2 CONT When Jean Baptiste Derome was born on 13 January 1734, in Quebec City, Québec, Canada, New France, his father, Jean Baptiste de Rom, was 25 and his mother, Marie Susanne Jeane, was 21. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie Rose Prou on 9 February 1756, in Saint-François-de-Sales, Québec, Canada, New France. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 5 daughters.
2 CONT Jean Baptiste Decareau 1759–1827
