1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LCPC-LB6
2 CONT Brief Life History of Marie Madeleine'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marie Madeleine Hunault was born on 16 June 1731, in Montreal, Canada, New France, her father, Gabriel Hunaut, was 36 and her mother, Marie Madeleine Mauffet, was 19. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Jean Baptiste de Rom/ Derome on 14 April 1755, in Notre-Dame de Québec, Quebec City, Québec, Canada, New France. They were the parents of at least 7 sons and 4 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 13 August 1797, in Lower Canada, British North America, at the age of 66, and was buried in Notre-Dame, Montreal, Quebec, Canada.
