2 CONC tacks area, call number CS81.T312 (1967) [Quebec baptismal, marriage and burial information into the late 1700s].
2 CONT Leboeuf, Complement au Dictionnaire Genealogique Tanguay, (two series in one publication); Montreal, 1957; available at the Library of Congress, Local History and Genealogy Room, call number CS81.T3 (suppl) [corrections and additi
2 CONC ons to Tanguayup to about 1800].
2 CONT Jette, Dictionnaire Genealogique des Familles du Quebec; Montreal, University of Montreal Press, 1983; available at the Library of Congress, Local History and Genealogy Room, open stacks area, call number CS88.Q4J47 (1983) [birth/
2 CONC baptismal, marriage and death/burial information up to the end of 1730].
