2 CONT http://familytreemaker.genealogy.com/users/h/e/n/Louise-R-Henson/WEBSITE-0001/UHP-0207.html Therese Henault-Canada (b. 1702, d. date unknown)  Therese Henault-Canada (daughter of Pierre Enaud and Marie-Anne Ratel-Dragon) was born 
2 CONC 1702, and died date unknown. She married Jean-Baptiste Martin (dit St.Jean) on August 08, 1723 in Montreal, Que.,Canada (Notre Dame), son of Joseph Martin and Jeanne Dionet. Includes NotesNotes for Therese Henault-Canada: Therese 
2 CONC (Bertha ?) Enaud dit Canada (Henault Canada) More About Therese Henault-Canada and Jean-Baptiste Martin (dit St.Jean): Marriage: August 08, 1723, Montreal, Que.,Canada (Notre Dame). Children of Therese Henault-Canada and Jean-Bapt
2 CONC iste Martin (dit St.Jean) are:     Madeleine Martin, b. date unknown, d. date unknown.     Marguerite Martin, d. date unknown.     Pierre-Jean Martin, b. July 12, 1724, Bout-de-l'Ile,Que., d. March 13, 1758, Soulanges, Que. (St.Jo
2 CONC s.de Soulanges).     Jean-Baptiste Martin, b. March 22, 1725/26, Bout-de-l'Ile, Que., d. date unknown.     Marie-Joseph Martin, b. April 01, 1728, d. date unknown.     Marie- Charlotte Martin, b. January 06, 1730/31, d. date unkno
2 CONC wn.     Marguerite-Joseph Martin, b. October 26, 1732, Bout-de-l'Ile, Que. ?, d. March 01, 1732/33, Bout-de-l'Ile, Que. ?.     Francois-Amable Martin, b. February 07, 1733/34, d. date unknown.     Therese Martin, b. May 19, 1742, 
2 CONC d. date unknown.     +Joseph Martin, b. Abt. 1750, Bellevue ? St.Jos. de Soulanges, Vaudreuil ?, d. date unknown.
