2 CONT Brief Life History of Marie Geneviève'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marie Geneviève Drouillard was born on 14 December 1800, in Sandwich, Essex, Upper Canada, British North America, her father, Louis Drouillard, was 32 and her mother, Marie Catherine Meloche, was 26. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Jean Baptiste Lucier on 15 September 1818, in L'Assomption, Essex, Canada West, British North America. They were the parents of at least 7 sons and 3 daughters. 
2 CONT Catherine Lucier 1820–1867
2 CONT Jean Baptiste Lucier 1821–1892
2 CONT JANVIER LUCIER 1824–1824
2 CONT Henriette Lucier Lussier 1825–1862
2 CONT Angélique Lucier 1828–
2 CONT Charles Lucier 1832–1888
2 CONT Hilaire Hubert Lucier 1834–1834
2 CONT Denis Lucier 1836–1914
2 CONT Grégoire Lucier 1839–1917
2 CONT Augustin Bénonie Lucier 1842–1842
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 19 January 1844, in Essex, Canada West, British North America, at the age of 43, and was buried in Saint John The Baptist Cemetery, Amherstburg, Essex, Ontario, Canada.
