1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Edward Drouillard was born on May 6 1820, in Columbus, Franklin, Ohio, United States, to Simeon Kenton Drouillard and Cynthia Drouillard (born Billups). Simeon was born circa 1801, in Kenton's Station, Kentucky, Un
2 CONC ited States. Cynthia was born on MAR 1801 OR MAR 1802, in South Carolina, United States. Edward had 7 siblings: William Drouillard, Joseph Drouillard, Margaret Wagy (born Drouillard), Louisa Smith (born Drouillard), Jane "Jenny" D
2 CONC enny (born Drouillard), Miss Drouilliard and Elizabeth Mathews (born Drouillard).
2 CONT
2 CONT Edward married Susan Drouillard (born Topping) on April 8 1848, at age 27 in Knoxville, Marion, Iowa, United States.
2 CONT
2 CONT Susan was born circa 1822, in Virginia, United States. Edward passed away on September 19 1897, at age 77 in Kern, California, United States.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.myheritage.com/names/edward_drouillard
