2 CONT Brief Life History of Marie Charlotte
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marie Charlotte Poitier was born on 17 September 1762, in Pointe-du-Lac, Saint-Maurice, Quebec, Canada, her father, Jean Joseph Pothier, was 31 and her mother, Marie Madeleine Cadoret, was 36. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Charles Gilbert Comtois on 27 January 1783, in Berthierville, Berthier, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 4 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 18 July 1851, in Saint-Gabriel-de-Brandon, Berthier, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 88, and was buried in Saint-Gabriel-de-Brandon, D'Autray, Quebec, Canada.
