2 CONT Brief Life History of Elizabeth'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Elizabeth Dubois was born about 1748, in Montreal, Quebec, Canada, her father, François Marie Dubois, was 24 and her mother, Marie Françoise Poulin, was 13. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Ezechiel Solomon on 23 July 1769, in Montreal, Quebec, British North America. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 2 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 1813, in Mackinaw City, Cheboygan, Michigan, United States, at the age of 68
