1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/KH33-CJ1
2 CONT Brief Life History of Marie Marguerite'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marie Marguerite Dubois was born on 13 February 1781, in Saint-Mathias, Rouville, Quebec, Canada, her father, François Marie Dubois, was 55 and her mother, Marie Françoise Poulin, was 44. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Leger François Hamel on 21 October 1799, in Saint-Jean-Baptiste, Rouville, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 10 sons and 7 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 23 November 1852, in Saint-Jean-Baptiste, Quebec City, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 71, and was buried in Saint-Jean-Baptiste, Quebec, Quebec, Canada.
2 CONT ------------------------------------------
2 CONT
