2 DATE 23 MAY 1718
2 PLAC Lauzon, Quebec, Canada
2 ADDR
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Notes for Jean Baptiste Duquet: 1651 - When Jean was baptized, his godparents were Jean LeMire (married to Louise Maisolet) and his mother's young half-sister Marguerite Sevestre.
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Jean Baptiste Duquet: Baptism Sponsors: Jean LeMire/Marguerite Sevestre DIT: Desrochers
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Catherine Ursule Amyot: Baptism Sponsors: Catherine Legardieur
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for Jean Duquet and Catherine Amyot: Jean Duquet dit Desoches married Catherine Ursule Amyot on 11 November 1683 in Lauzon at Neuville. Witnesses at the wedding were his mother, Catherine Gauthier; Catherine Ursule'
2 CONC s parents, Mathieu Amoit and marie Miville; Jean's uncle, Louis Roer de Villeray and his second wife, marie Anne Dusassay; his brothers: Pierre Duquet de la Chesnaye, Louis Duquet Sieur Duverdier and Joseph Duquet. Anne La Marre, 
2 CONC Pierre's wife; Jean's sister marie Therese and his uncle Charles Gauthier were also in attendance. The brides's brothers, Charles Amoit, Pierre Amiot dit Villeneauve and his wife Louis Taudiere; Jean Baptiste Amoit, Sieur de Leuvi
2 CONC lle and his wife Genevieve Guyon; Jean Amoit, Daniel Joseph Amoit and Matheu Amoit were pesent. Her sister, Annie Marie Amiot and her jusband Jean Joly were there and also Marguerite, Francoise and their husbands Charles Gingras a
2 CONC nd Jean Huard.
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Jean Duquet and Catherine Amyot: Marriage: 11 November 1683, Pointe aux Trembles, Quebec
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Jean Duquet and Catherine Amyot are: 1	i.	Jean Baptiste Duquet, born 07 November 1685 in Quebec, Canada; died 16 April 1731 in Quebec, Canada; married Geneveive Halle 20 August 1710 in St. Joseph, Levis, Quebec, Canada
2 CONC . ii.	Gabriel Duquet, born 07 August 1687 in Quebec City, Canada; died 12 October 1759; married (1) Marguerite Halle 01 June 1722 in Lauzon, Quebec, Canada; married (2) Marie-Madeline Grondin 23 May 1737.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://boards.ancestry.com/localities.northam.usa.states.newyork.counties.clinton/4088.1.1/mb.ashx
2 CONT
2 CONT Another possible death date is 8/20/1710.
