1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 1. Jean Baptiste Duquet, born 07 November 1685 in Quebec, Canada; died 16 April 1731 in Quebec, Canada. He was the son of 2. Jean Baptiste Duquet and 3. Catherine Ursule Amyot. He married (1) Geneveive Halle 20 Aug
2 CONC ust 1710 in St. Joseph, Levis, Quebec, Canada. She was born 1685, and died 16 April 1731 in Quebec, Canada. She was the daughter of Jean Baptiste Halle and Marie Maranda.
