2 CONC rie Anne, 1741-1822; Joseph, 1743-1816; Etienne, 1745-1759; Charles, 1748-1748; Suzanne, 1749-1785; Angelique, 1752-1790; and Louis Simon, 1754-1754. Died in Lauzon on January 27, 1797.
