1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LHRM-SS2
2 CONT Brief Life History of Marie Anne'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marie Anne Titley was born on 24 July 1790, in Vaudreuil, Montreal, Quebec, British North America, her father, Martin Titley, was 41 and her mother, Marie Reine Langlois, was 23. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Michel Félix Diquiere on 23 November 1813, in Deux-Montagnes, Canada East, British North America. They were the parents of at least 7 sons and 6 daughters. 
2 CONT Felix Dicaire 1811–1856
2 CONT Michel Félix Dicaire 1814–1884
2 CONT Marie Euphrosine Dicaire 1816–1860
2 CONT Louis Dicaire 1819–1831
2 CONT Marie Dicaire 1821–1854
2 CONT Anthime Dicaire 1823–1854
2 CONT Edithe Dicaire 1823–
2 CONT Marie Marcelline Dicaire 1825–1911
2 CONT Antoine Dicaire 1827–1833
2 CONT Marie Josephte Dicaire 1830–1907
2 CONT Pierre Dicaire 1832–1907
2 CONT Marie Marguerite Dicaire 1832–
2 CONT Baby Son Dicaire 1834–
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 5 May 1851, in L'Annonciation de l'Oka, Deux-Montagnes, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 60, and was buried in L'Annonciation, Oka, Deux-Montagnes, Quebec, Canada.
