1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LHZH-T3P
2 CONT Brief Life History of Nicolas Louis'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Nicolas Louis Jacques was born on 20 March 1724, in Charlesbourg, Québec, Canada, New France, his father, Louis Jacques, was 30 and his mother, Marie Marguerite Segouin, was 27. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie Louise Helene Lanceleur on 18 April 1746, in Quebec City, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 7 sons and 6 daughters. 
2 CONT Marie Barbe Jacques 1747–
2 CONT Jean Baptiste Jacques 1747–1817
2 CONT Germain Jacques 1749–1813
2 CONT Marie Magdeleine Jaques 1750–1755
2 CONT Marie Marguerite Jacques 1750–1750
2 CONT Marie Josephe Jacques 1751–1838
2 CONT Nicolas Jacques 1752–
2 CONT Pierre Noel Jacques 1753–1845
2 CONT Marie Louise Jacques (1) 1755–1854
2 CONT Joseph Charles Jacques 1757–1810
2 CONT Jean Antoine Jacques 1761–1819
2 CONT Marie Louise Jacques (2) 1763–1763
2 CONT Joseph Jacques 1768–1810
2 CONT
2 CONT He lived in Charlesbourg, Quebec City, Quebec, Canada in 1724. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 28 August 1800, in Île aux Grues, Montmagny, Canada East, British North America, at the age of 76, and was buried in Cap-Saint-Ignace, Montmagny, Quebec, Canada.
