2 CONT Brief Life History of Marie Rose'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marie Rose Prou was born on 29 January 1730, in Neuville, Portneuf, Quebec, Canada, her father, Jean Baptiste Prou, was 50 and her mother, Marie Genevieve Arbour, was 37. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Jean Baptiste Derome on 9 February 1756, in Saint-François-de-Sales, Québec, Canada, New France. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 5 daughters.
