2 CONT Jacques Derome Descarreaux (2) 1772–
2 CONT Marie Madeleine Derome Descarreau 1774–
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 11 September 1800, in Cap-Santé, Portneuf, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 70.
