1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LRDF-N81
2 CONT Brief Life History of Angélique'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Angélique Lemaire was born on 22 June 1709, in Sainte-Anne-de-Bellevue, Montreal, Canada, New France, her father, Charles Lemaire St Germain, was 11706 and her mother, Clémence Rapin, was 24. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Louis Préjean on 8 January 1732, in Saints-Anges-Gardiens, Lachine, Montreal, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 6 sons and 5 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 16 June 1779, in Lachine, Montreal, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 69.
2 CONT
