2 CONT Joseph Derouen formerly Drouin aka De Rouen, De Rohan, Drouan, Drovan
2 CONT * Born 17 Feb 1736 in Sault-au-Recollects, Canada, Nouvelle-France
2 CONT * Son of Pierre Drouin and Marie Anne Vanier
2 CONT * Brother of Marie Genevieve Drouin, Jean-Louis Drouin, Marie Françoise Drouin, Jean Baptiste Drouin and Louis Gabriel Drouin
2 CONT * Husband of Charlotte (Campau) Drouin — married 21 Feb 1762 in Church of the Hurons, Sandwich, Ontariomap
2 CONT * Husband of Anne Genevieve (Hebert) Hébert — married 29 Nov 1775 in L'Ascension Church, Donaldsonville, Louisiana, New Spain
2 CONT * Father of Marie Charlotte (Drouin) Drouillard, Josette Drouin, Francoise Derouen, Joseph Marie Derouen, Genevieve (Derouan) Carlin, Jacques Derouen, Marie Francoise Derouen, Marie Rosalie (Derouen) Hayes and Victoria Adelaide He
2 CONC lene (Derouen) Leleux
2 CONT * Died 26 Jul 1819 at age 83 in Petite Anse, St. Martin Parish, Louisiana, United Statesmap
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT https://gw.geneanet.org/alonzo?lang=en&n=derouin&oc=0&p=joseph+francois+pierre
