2 CONT Joseph Francois Pierre Derouin
2 CONT Born February 18, 1736 - Montreal (Sault-au-Recollet)Parish of St Michel
2 CONT Deceased July 27, 1819 - St Martinville, LA. USA, aged 83 years old
2 CONT
