2 CONT Joseph Francois Pierre Derouen, 1737 - 1819
2 CONT MyHeritage Family Trees
2 CONT Joseph Francois Pierre Derouen was born on month day 1737, in birth place.
2 CONT Joseph had 5 siblings: Marie-Charlotte Crevier (born Drouin), Unknown Derouen and 3 other siblings.
2 CONT Joseph married Anne Genevieve Derouen (born Hebert) on month day 1775, at age 38 in marriage place, Louisiana.
2 CONT Anne was born on month day 1747, in birth place.
2 CONT They had 8 children: Joseph Marie Derouen, Genevieve Carlin (Carlini) (born Derouen or Drouin) and 6 other children.
2 CONT Joseph passed away on month day 1819, at age 81 in death place, Louisiana.
