2 CONT
2 CONT Louis Montmeny's death record is as follows: Ludovicus Momini, 19 Nov 1850, wife Margarite Gagner, age 82 (could be 92). Taken from St. Joseph Catholic Church in Erie, MI death records, entry 32.
2 CONT
2 CONT ---------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT St. Joseph Catholic Church, Erie, MI
2 CONT
2 CONT 1850
2 CONT
2 CONT #32
2 CONT
2 CONT Louis Momini died 19 December, widower of Margarite Gagner, at age 82/92, and buried the next day.
2 CONT
2 CONT P. D. Warlop, missionary
2 CONT
2 CONT NOTE: Either an 8 is written over a 9 or a 9 is written over an 8 for his age. According to his birth date he would have been 82 at the time of death but this number really looks like an 82 corrected to a 92.
2 CONT
