1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Note: This brother Pierre Henault dit DELORME married Marguerite Du Trempe.
2 CONT He is NOT brother Pierre Henault dit FRENIERE.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LTC5-6LT
2 CONT Brief Life History of Pierre'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Pierre Henaut dit Delorme was born on 11 September 1691, in Ville-Marie, Montreal, Canada, New France, his father, Pierre Hénault, was 23 and his mother, Marie Anne Ratelle, was 20. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marguerite Piette on 18 June 1720, in Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 6 sons and 5 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 27 October 1756, in Berthierville, Berthier, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 65, and was buried in Berthierville, Berthier, Quebec, Canada.
