1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/GFD9-BK2
2 CONT Brief Life History of Pierre'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Pierre Hénault dit Fresnier II was born on 27 January 1694, in Canada, New France, his father, Pierre Hénault, was 26 and his mother, Marie Anne Ratelle, was 23. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Geneviève Généreux on 4 February 1720, in Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 4 daughters. 
2 CONT Pierre Hénault Frenière III 1720–1791
2 CONT Nicolas Hénault 1723–1790
2 CONT François Hénault 1725–1794
2 CONT Geneviève Hénault 1727–1803
2 CONT Pierre Simon Hénault 1730–1802
2 CONT Marie Josephe Hénault 1732–1812
2 CONT Marie Madeleine Hénault 1734–1813
2 CONT Marie Anne Hénault 1741–1806
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 27 October 1756, in Berthierville, Berthier, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 62, and was buried in Sainte-Geneviève-de-Berthier, Berthier, Quebec, Canada.
2 CONT -------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT He was also known as Heneau, Enos, Enaul and Heneault dit Delorme.
2 CONT
