1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Note: Not the same sister as Marie Genevieve (born 1709)
2 CONT Some listings indicate name as Marie-Genevieve-Marguerite, but sourced records only indicate name for this sister as Marie-Marguerite.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/L2HG-68Y
2 CONT Brief Life History of Marie [Genevieve] Marguerite'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marie Marguerite Henault was born on 9 July 1696, in Sorel, Montreal, Canada, New France, her father, Pierre Hénault, was 28 and her mother, Marie Anne Ratelle, was 25. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Charles Boucher on 20 February 1713, in Saint-Pierre-de-Sorel, Richelieu, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 4 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 8 July 1741, in Saint-François-du-Lac, Odanak, Nicolet-Yamaska, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 44.
2 CONT
