1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/KFBT-1DS
2 CONT Brief Life History of Louis'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Louis Parnier dit Vadeboncoeur I was born on 20 February 1778, in Detroit, Wayne, Michigan, United States, his father, Joseph Parnier dit Vadeboncoeur I, was 40 and his mother, Marie Catherine Larivière, was 34. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married 1st wife Marie Françoise Revau Lajeunesse (1783-1805) on 29 November 1798, in Detroit, Wayne, Michigan, United States. They were the parents of at least 1 daughter. 
2 CONT Marie Louise Parnier dit Vadeboncoeur 1800 – 1883
2 CONT
2 CONT He married 2nd wife Véronique Lebeau (1787– )
2 CONT on 30 April 1805 in Detroit,Wayne,Michigan
2 CONT They had at least 2 sons and 2 daughters:
2 CONT Régina Parnier dit Vadeboncoeur 1805–
2 CONT Louis Parnier dit Vadeboncoeur II 1808–
2 CONT François Parnier dit Vadeboncoeur 1810–
2 CONT Elisabeth Parnier dit Vadeboncoeur 1812–1849
2 CONT
2 CONT He lived in Detroit, Northwest Territory, United States for about 6 years. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 4 October 1813, at the age of 35, and was buried in Sandwich, Essex, Ontario, Canada.
