2 CONT ID: I05890 Name: Marie Angelique DUFOUR Sex: F Birth: 22 JUN 1777 in Sandwich Township, Essex County, On. Death: SEP 1849 in Petite Cote, Assumption, Sandwich, Essex County, On. Burial: SEP 1849 Petite Cote, Assumption, Sandwich, 
