2 CONT '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LH64-941
2 CONT Brief Life History of Jean Baptiste'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Jean Baptiste Lucier was born on 2 April 1797, in Sandwich, Essex, Upper Canada, British North America, his father, Augustin Lucier  Dusseau, was 31 and his mother, Françoise Bénéteau, was 22. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie Geneviève Drouillard on 15 September 1818, in L'Assomption, Essex, Canada West, British North America. They were the parents of at least 7 sons and 3 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 31 January 1875, in Colchester, Essex, Ontario, Canada, at the age of 77, and was buried in Saint John The Baptist Cemetery, Amherstburg, Essex, Ontario, Canada.
