2 CONT Brief Life History of Angélique'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Angélique Lucier was born on 22 November 1828, in Sandwich, Essex, Ontario, Canada, her father, Jean Baptiste Lucier, was 31 and her mother, Marie Geneviève Drouillard, was 27. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Toussaint Girard on 29 January 1850, in Amherstburg, Essex, Ontario, Canada. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 3 daughters.
2 CONT Mary Girard 1853–
2 CONT Joseph T Girard 1856–
2 CONT Jean Baptiste Girard 1858–1933
2 CONT Jacques James Girard 1861–1941
2 CONT Louis Girard 1866–
2 CONT Archange Elizabeth Girard 1867–
2 CONT Aurelie Girard 1869–1930
