1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Eli is the son of Julius & Pauline Janisse. He was born in Tecumsah, Essex, Ontario in April 1857. Around 1878 he married Elizabeth Pajot in Essex County, Ontario. In 1891 he and his family were living in Sandwich 
2 CONC East in Essex, Ontario. He bought his family to Detroit just before 1900.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1900 & 1910 he was working as a horseshoer. He was retired in 1920. Eli died at home from chronic myocarditis & nephritis. He is buried next to his wife in Mt. Olivet Cemetery.
