1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LZBQ-VKS
2 CONT Brief Life History of Henry Theodore'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Henry Theodore Roy was born on 1 January 1791, in Sainte-Anne-de-la-Pocatière, District Judiciaire de Québec, Quebec, British North America, his father, Pierre Martin Roy dit Lauzier, was 28 and his mother, Marie Madeleine Pl
2 CONC ourde, was 25. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married 1st wife Marie Louise Gagnon (1794-1842) on 16 January 1816, in Sainte-Anne-de-la-Pocatière, La Pocatière, Kamouraska, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 4 daughters. 
2 CONT Marie Louise Elizabeth Roy 1818–
2 CONT Henri Allaire Roy 1821–1889
2 CONT Adolphe Roy 1825–1901
2 CONT Henriette Roy 1828–1890
2 CONT Adéline Roy 1830–1864
2 CONT Louis Roy 1831–1909
2 CONT Emerance Roy about 1840–
2 CONT
2 CONT He married 2nd wife Marie Judith Morin (1795–1863) on 2 July 1844
2 CONT Saint-Roch-des-Aulnaies, L'Islet, Québec, Canada
2 CONT No children on record
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 9 August 1864, in Sainte-Anne-de-la-Pocatière, La Pocatière, Kamouraska, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 73, and was buried in Sainte-Anne-de-la-Pocatière, La Pocatière, Kamouraska, Quebec, Canada.
2 CONT
