2 CONT
2 CONT Marguerite Angelique Descomps dit Labadie was the daughter of Pierre Descomps dit Labadie and Marie Angelique de Lacelle. Marguerite married Martin Levry on January 22, 1759. Their son, Jacques Levry dit Martin, is also buried at 
2 CONC St. Antoine Cemetery. Marguerite's nephew, Medard Labady (Medard Descomps dit Labadie) was a heroic figure in the War of 1812.  
