1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Who keeps adding “Wyandotte” ?  
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie Catherine Cuillerier dit Beaubean was the daughter of Jean Baptiste Cuillerier dit Beaubien and Marie Anne Lootman dit Barrois.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the sister of Jean Baptiste Cuillerier (same name as his father) who was born 15 Apr. 1745 in Detroit and died 3 Aug. 1782 in Detroit. He married Genevieve Parent who was the sister of her husband, Joseph aka Jacques Paren
2 CONC t.
