2 CONT Brief Life History of Sophie
2 CONT
2 CONT When Sophie Solomon was born on 13 January 1771, in Montreal, Quebec, Canada, her father, Ezechiel Solomon, was 36 and her mother, Elizabeth Dubois, was 24. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Isidore Pelletier on 23 July 1798, in Saint Ignace, Mackinac, Michigan, United States. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 2 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 28 March 1815, in Detroit, Wayne, Michigan, United States, at the age of 44
