2 CONT Brief Life History of Jeanne Anne
2 CONT
2 CONT When Jeanne Anne Amiot was born on 22 November 1670, in Notre-Dame de Québec, Quebec City, Québec, Canada, New France, her father, Matthieu Amiot, was 42 and her mother, Marie Miville, was 37. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Paul Tessier on 26 February 1691, in Neuville, Québec, Canada, New France. They were the parents of at least 2 sons and 6 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 9 February 1749, in Laprairie, Montreal, Canada, New France, at the age of 78, and was buried in Laprairie, Montreal, Canada, New France.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Écolière des Urselines de Québec elle aussi comme ses soeurs
2 CONT --------------------
