2 CONT Date of her marriage to Denys was 1638, making her about 13 when wed, they ended up with 9 children, her first wasn't born till 1642/43 so she was about 17 or 18 when she had her 1st child.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was born in France, and in Canada with her parents, he was a wealthy fur trader, the settled on a frm on the Cote-de-Lauzon, they had 30 acres, of cleared land, and 8 animals in the barn according to census of 1667. 
