1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Born on December 13, 1766 in Lauzon, Levis, Quebec, Canada. Married Cecile Filteau on November 23, 1795 in St. Etienne de Beaumont, Bellechasse, Quebec, Canada. Had eleven children JEAN BAPTISTE born in 1796; Ignac
2 CONC e, 1798-1808; Charles, 1800-1883; Joseph, 1801-1860; Antoine, 1803-1804; Antoine, 1805-1808; Cecile, 1807-1888; unnamed daughter. 1808-1808, Marie Josephte, 1810-1810; Michel, 1813-1872; and Hubert, 1817-1876. All children  were b
2 CONC orn in Lauzon (St. Joseph de Levis), Levis, Quebec, Canada. Died in St. Jean Chrysostome, Levis, Quebec, Canada on November 18,1831.
2 CONT
