1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LH1M-L12
2 CONT Brief Life History of Marie Rosalie'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marie Rosalie Samson was born on 30 October 1744, in Saint-Joseph-de-la-Pointe-De Lévy, Desjardins, Lévis, Quebec, Canada, her father, Ignace Samson, was 26 and her mother, Rosalie Boulé, was 29. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married 1st husband Francois Mathieu Langlois (1733-1796) on 16 November 1761, in Sainte-Geneviève, Île-de-Montréal, Montreal, Canada, New France. They were the parents of at least 9 sons and 8 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married 2nd husband Augustin Leduc (1742–1803) on 29 May 1797
2 CONT in Oka, Deux-Montagnes, Quebec, Canada. No children.
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 5 February 1824, in Lévis, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 79.
2 CONT -------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
