2 CONT Antoine Seguin (1756 - 1837)
2 CONT Born 8 Oct 1756 in Oka, Deux-Montagnes, Canada, Nouvelle-France 
2 CONT Died 22 Jun 1837 at age 80 in Saint-Benoît, Deux-Montagnes, Bas-Canada
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Jean Baptiste (Seguin) Seguin dit Ladéroute  and Marguerite (Tourangeau) Seguin 
2 CONT
