1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/L256-VR5
2 CONT Brief Life History of Michel'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Michel Langlois was born on 2 September 1784, in Cap-Saint-Ignace, Montmagny, Quebec, Canada, his father, Jean-Baptiste Pascal Langlois, was 28 and his mother, Marie Josephe Jacques, was 33. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie Anne Normandeau dit Deslauriers on 7 November 1815, in Notre-Dame de Québec, Quebec City, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 2 sons. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 30 September 1868, at the age of 84.
