1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/L8F3-L99
2 CONT Brief Life History of Marie Thérèze Marguerite
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marie Thérèze [Therese] Marguerite Gignac was born on 31 October 1748, in Sainte-Famille-du-Cap-Santé, Québec, Canada, New France, her father, Jacques Gignac, was 28 and her mother, Marie Françoise Anne Lafond, was 29. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Jean Baptiste Derome Decareau on 15 July 1782, in Sainte-Famille-du-Cap-Santé, District Judiciaire de Québec, Quebec, British North America. They were the parents of at least 4 sons. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 9 May 1790, in Sainte-Famille-du-Cap-Santé, District Judiciaire de Québec, Quebec, British North America, at the age of 41, and was buried in Sainte-Famille-du-Cap-Santé, District Judiciaire de Québec, Quebec, British 
2 CONC North America.
