1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LH1N-LK4
2 CONT Brief Life History of Joseph'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Joseph Lallier-Marcheterre was born on 16 August 1756, in Sainte-Famille-du-Cap-Santé, Québec, Canada, New France, his father, Denis Lallier, was 31 and his mother, Marguerite Paquin, was 22. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie Rose Derome dit  Décareau on 21 January 1782, in Sainte-Famille-du-Cap-Santé, District Judiciaire de Québec, Quebec, British North America. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 7 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 1 November 1822, in Saint-Pierre-les-Becquets, Bécancour, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 66, and was buried in Saint-Pierre-les-Becquets, Bécancour, Quebec, Canada.
2 CONT -----------------------------------
