2 CONT Mathieu Perrin Gareau (son of Joseph Henri Perrin and Marie Jeanne Merrin) was born 21 Sep 1664 in Monteal, and died 27 Jul 1742 in Ste Anne de Bellevue. He married Marie Therese Pilette, daughter of Francois Pilette and Francoise
2 CONC  Loiselle.
