2 CONT 1701 June 28, -Mathieu Perrin alias Garao (Garno), Gavahau and Garau (1664-1742) Voyageur West October 2: Mathieu Perrin dit Garaho (Garaut) arrived Fort Detroit, New France (Michigan), with his country wife married 1688/89 as pri
