1 NOTE Married 12 Sep 1678 Thomas Mezeray (bap. 4 Dec 1652 at Sillery; son of Rene & Helene Chastel) at Notre Dame de Immaculee Conception de Quebec, Quebec, Canada; have copy of this record; sources: (c. 08-08 Gilles Rageot); family (4 
2 CONC children) listed in Jette pg 806-807; Tanguay Vol I pg 457, 461; Tanguay Vol I pg 429 shows this family with 4 children.
2 CONT Remarried 18 Jun 1691 Hillaire Sureau (son of Jacques & Honore Pollet) at Notre Dame de Immaculee Conception de Quebec, Quebec, Canada; have copy of this record; sources: (c. 13-07-1690 Gilles Rageot); family (8 children) listed i
2 CONC n Jette pg 1058; Drouin pg 1257; Tanguay Vol I pg 556 shows this family with 6 children; Tanguay Vol I pg 461.
2 CONT Remarried 24 Sep 1713 to Jean-Baptiste Jarry-Lahaie (bap. 13 Aug 1755 at Montreal; son of Eloi Jarry & Jeanne Merrin) at Montreal; sources: (c. 18 Adhemar); family (no children) listed in Jette pg 594; Drouin pg 694; Tanguay Vol I
2 CONC V pg 591 shows this family with no children.
