1 NOTE Additional reference: 54-6.
2 CONT She first married 12 Nov 1648 to Leonard Lucos, aka Babot, (son of Francois Lucos & Magdeleine Bigaton; bap 1626; bur 18 Jun 1651 at Montreal, he was killed by the Hurons)  in Montreal;  Tanguay Vol I pg 400 shows 1 child, Marie L
2 CONC ucas, was born of this marriage ; she married 13 April 1665 to Rene Cuillerier in Montreal; sources: Tanguay Vol I pg 109 , 400;  <http://www.scarolina.com/brunette/AncsOfNorm.htm> (copy filed 54-3 & 54-4).
2 CONT Tanguay Vol I pg 109; 400; Vol II pg 590.
2 CONT "Your Ancient Canadian Family Ties"-Olivier pg 216.
2 CONT "Origin of French Canadian Families"-Godbout pg 154.
2 CONT "La Conquete du Canada par les Normands"-Godbout pg 65.
2 CONT Jette pg 212; 932.
2 CONT "La Grande Recrue de 1653"-Auger pg 115.
2 CONT Database of Gilles C. Paquette from the internet (copy filed 54-2; 54-6).
2 CONT "Origine de Familles Canadiennes-Françaises"-Godbout pg 154.
2 CONT <http://www.genealogie.com/cgi-bin/fo/afficher.cgi?i> (copy filed 54-3).
2 CONT Marriage contract 09 Nov Closse.
2 CONT Drouin pg 234.
2 CONT ------------------------------------------------
2 CONT 1666 Montreal Census shows the following:
2 CONT Gabriel LeScel aka LeClos 40 Head of household
2 CONT Barbe Poisson 32 Spouse
2 CONT Marguerite LeScel 9 daughter
2 CONT Gabriel LeScel 6 Son
2 CONT Barbe LeScel 3 Daughter
2 CONT -------------------------------------------------
2 CONT The following was acquired from:  <http://www.genforum.genealogy.com/poisson/messages/266.html>.
2 CONT
2 CONT Re: Barbe POISSON, child of Jean POISSON
2 CONT Posted by: Marjorie Barron (ID *****7254) Date: April 04, 2002 at 08:48:54
2 CONT In Reply to: Barbe POISSON, child of Jean POISSON by Al Chaput  of 385
2 CONT
2 CONT I do have more than one Jean Poisson and more than one Barbe Poisson. Barbe Poisson b. abt. 1634 in St. John de Mortagne, Perche, France, d. January 07, 1711 in Montreal, Quebec, daughter of Jean Poisson and Barbe Broust (a.k.a. B
2 CONC arbe Broue), m. 1. Leonard Lucault dit Barbot on October 12, 1648 in Ville-Marie, Montreal, Quebec, m. 2. Gabriel Celles dit Duclos November 19, 1651 in Montreal, Quebec. Then there is Barbe Poisson b. April 07, 1645 in St. Jean d
2 CONC e Mortange, Perche, France, d. April 23, 1645, daughter of Jean Poisson (brother of the aforementioned Barbe Poisson) and Jacqueline Chamboy. Since the second Barbe Poisson died before she was even one month old, I know that this 
2 CONC is not the Barbe Poisson that you seek. Let me see what gencircles.com might have on your Barbe Poisson... Barbe Poisson b. 1615 in Evreux, Normandy, France, m. Thomas Roussel abt. 1635 in Evreux, Normandy, France (had a daughter 
2 CONC together named Charlotte). One of the search results on gencircles.com did show that this Barbe Poisson's parents were Jean Poisson and Barbe Provost, but there are no sources to back it up. You might try gencircles.com or the LDS
2 CONC  website and see what else you can come up with. -Marjorie :)
2 CONT -------------------------------------------------
2 CONT The following was acquired from:  <http://www.delmars.com/family/perrault/6914.htm>.
2 CONT
