2 CONT
2 CONT Barbe Poisson
2 CONT Born: Abt 1633, St-Jean de Mortagne, ev. Sees, Perche, France 1
2 CONT Marriage (1): Léonard Lucos aka Barbot on 12 Oct 1648 in Montréal, Québec, Canada 1
2 CONT Marriage (2): Gabriel De Celles aka Duclos Sieur du Sailly on 19 Nov 1651 in Montréal, Québec, Canada 1
2 CONT Buried: 7 Jan 1711, Montréal, Québec, Canada 1
2 CONT
2 CONT General Notes:
2 CONT
2 CONT IMMIGRATION: 1647, Fille à Marier
2 CONT
2 CONT Barbe married Léonard Lucos aka Barbot, son of François Lucos and Madeleine Bagaton, on 12 Oct 1648 in Montréal, Québec, Canada.1 (Léonard Lucos aka Barbot was born in St-Jean d'Aureil, Limoges, Limousin, France,1 died on 20 Jun 1
2 CONC 651 in Montréal, Québec, Canada 1 and was buried on 20 Jun 1651 in Montréal, Québec, Canada 1.)
2 CONT
2 CONT Barbe next married Gabriel De Celles aka Duclos Sieur du Sailly on 19 Nov 1651 in Montréal, Québec, Canada.1 (Gabriel De Celles aka Duclos Sieur du Sailly was born about 1626 in Nonant, Bayeux, Normandie, France 1 and died on 15 N
2 CONC ov 1671 in Montréal, Québec, Canada 1.)
2 CONT
