1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LHKZ-N9B
2 CONT Brief Life History of Angelique'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Angelique Prejean was born on 20 April 1736, in Lachine, Montreal, Quebec, Canada, her father, Louis Préjean, was 28 and her mother, Angélique Lemaire, was 26. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Antoine Prévost on 19 September 1757, in Lachine, Jacques-Cartier, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 9 daughters. 
2 CONT Marie Angelique Provost 1758–1759
2 CONT Antoine Provost (1) 1759–1759 died in infancy
2 CONT Angelique Provost 1760–1801
2 CONT Therese Amable Provost 1762–1765
2 CONT Marie Catherine Prevost 1765–
2 CONT Antoine Prevost II 1766–1824
2 CONT Marie Louise Prévost 1767–1767
2 CONT Marie Louise Prévost 1768–1769
2 CONT Jean- Baptiste Prévost 1770–1771
2 CONT Louis Prévost 1774–1857
2 CONT twin Marie Josephte Provost 1776–1776
2 CONT twin Rosalie Provost 1776–1776
2 CONT Marie Angélique Prévost 1779–
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 24 October 1815, in Vaudreuil, Vaudreuil, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 79, and was buried in Saint-Michel-de-Vaudreuil, Vaudreuil, Quebec, Canada.
2 CONT
