2 CONT Title: Jetté - Dictionnaire genealogique de familles du Québec des origines a 1730
2 CONT Author: René Jetté Publication: Les Presses de l'Universite de Montréal, Montréal, Québec, 1983 Page: 180 
2 CONT
2 CONT Title: Madonna's French Canadian Ancestry Author: René Jetté & Gail Moreau
2 CONT  Page: Vol. 15 #3, Jul 1994 (71-84) & Vol 16 #4, Oct 1994 (125-136) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mathurin BRUNET was born in France, and died BEF 28 NOV 1663 in France. He married Marie BRUNET in France. She was born in France, and died BEF 28 NOV 1663 in France. 	
2 CONT 	Child of Mathurin BRUNET and Marie BRUNET is :+	2	i.	Antoine BRUNET , dit Belhumeur was born BET 1642 AND 1644 in St Nicolas, La Rochelle, Aunis (Charente-Maritime), France, and died BET 15 NOV 1688 AND 4 JUN 1695 in Montréal, Qu
2 CONC ébec, Canada. He married Françoise MOISAN 28 NOV 1663 in Montréal, Québec, Canada, daughter of Abel MOISAN and Marie SIMIOT. She was born BET 1644 AND 1645 in St Berthelemi, La Rochelle, Aunis (Charente-Maritime), France, and died
2 CONC  2 NOV 1718 in Contrecoeur, Québec. She was buried 2 NOV 1718 in Contrecoeur, Québec.
2 CONT
