1 OCCU Fille du roi, Fille Du Roi, Fille du Roy, Arrivée en 1667, apportant des biens estimés à 50 livres
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} BLANCHARD, Marie	290011 Statut	Mariée Date de naissance	Vers 1649 Lieu d'origine	Rouen (Seine-Maritime) 76540 Parents	Jean et Martine Lebas Date de mariage des parents	16-04-1646 Lieu de mariage des parents	Rouen (
2 CONC Ste-Nicaise) (76540) Première mention au pays	1667 Occupation à l'arrivée	Fille du Roi Date de mariage	10-11-1667 Lieu du mariage	Québec (Notre-Dame) Conjoint	Mathieu Brunet Décès ou inhumation	Lachine, 29-07-1722 Identification	D
2 CONC GFQ, p. 180 Chercheur(s)	Éric Mardoc Date de modification	2006-08-10
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Marie Blanchard was an orphan sent to Québec by the King of France to wed. She therefore had the name of fille du Roi (daughter of the King). She had no endowment known so far. She came from Normandie, France and arrived in Nouvel
2 CONC le-France on September 25, 1667 on the ship "Le Saint Louis."
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT http://gw.geneanet.org/ra41dr07?lang=en;p=marie;n=blanchard;oc=2
2 CONT
2 CONT F  Marie Blanchard Born about 1649 - Rouen, (Saint-Nicaise), (Charente-Maritime), France  Deceased 29 July 1722 (Wednesday) - Lachine, Qc , age at death: possibly 73 years old  Buried 29 July 1722 (Wednesday) - Lachine, Qc  Parent
2 CONC s: Jean Blanchard Martine Lebas 
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouses and children:  Married 10 November 1667 (Thursday) , Québec, (Notre-Dame), Qc, to Mathieu-Michel Brunet\Létang ca 1646-1708 (see note)  with
2 CONT
2 CONT M Michel Brunet\Létang ca 1668-1750 F Jeanne Brunet ca 1670-  F Marie-Anne Brunet\Létang ca 1672-1747  M Jean Brunet\Létang 1674-1723  F Marie Brunet 1677-1756  M Jacques Brunet\Létang 1680-ca 1708  F Catherine Brunet 1681-
2 CONT
2 CONT Married about 1713 , Lachine, Qc, to Yves-Luc Lucas\St-Velan ca 1649-1726
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes: Individual Note: Fille du roi arrivée en 1667 avec des biens de 50 livres./"Daughter of the king" arrived in 1667 with assets of 50 pounds. Family Note: Marriage with Mathieu-Michel Brunet\Létang: Contrat de mariage: [14 av
2 CONC ril 1679] (Source: Contrat Adhémar, Antoine)
2 CONT
2 CONT -----------------------------------------------
