2 CONT
2 CONT His real name is Joseph Fry, son of Adrain and Hanna Sara White. He was taken prisoner during the attack on the village Kittery after living ten years in an Indian mission. It is released. He spends a wedding cotrat in 1707 but it
2 CONC  was canceled and it was only after having obtained French nationailité he married.  Source: Marcel Fournier 
2 CONT
