2 CONT
2 CONT > LaFramboise (rasberry) is a "dit" name for some VIAU/VEAU/VEAUX
2 CONT
2 CONT > etc family.It is also the name taken by one of the soldiers of
2 CONT
2 CONT > the Carignan Regiment that came to Canada in 1665... almost all
2 CONT
2 CONT > 1,000 enlisted men were assigned a dit name that they used
2 CONT
2 CONT > throughout their 3 year contract in Canada...these dit names are
2 CONT
2 CONT > usually taken from the animal,mineral,vegetable,family
2 CONT
2 CONT > profession,physical characteristics,geographical locations
2 CONT
2 CONT > etc.Some of these dit names became real surnames and were carried
2 CONT
2 CONT > down ...
2 CONT
2 CONT > Jacques Veaux/VIEAU was a famous fur trader who worked the
2 CONT
2 CONT > Mackinac/Green Bay/Milwaukee area. He was Co-founder of
2 CONT
2 CONT > Milwaukee, WI along with Solomon Juneau...Jacques' dau married
2 CONT
2 CONT > Solomon in 1820.
2 CONT
2 CONT > Jacques was married to Angelique LeRoi/Leroy (Metis) about 1790
2 CONT
2 CONT > and had 11 children. A dau, Josette Vieaux b.1804 d. 1855
