1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Joachim Jacques Labrosse was born on March 20, 1728 to Raymond Labrosse Raymond and Marie Louise Clement Lariviere Chambly. Joachim was baptized on the day of his birth in Pointe-Claire. His godparents were Jacques Seguin and Mari
2 CONC e Morel.
2 CONT
2 CONT Joachim married Marie Louise Daoust on February 19, 1748 in Pointe-Claire, Quebec. Their first child Pierre Joachim (m. Marie Francoise Lauzon), was born on June 15, 1749. They had 15 more children: Marie Francoise (m. Jean Jamme 
2 CONC Carriere), Joachim (m. Marie Judith Groulx), Antoine Amable (died at 27 years of age), Francois Amable (no record on him past his birth), Raymond (m. Marie Josephe Brunet Letang), Marie Louise (lived 13 days), Jean Baptiste (lived
2 CONC  3 months), Joseph (m. Marie Rose Biroleau Lafleur), Jean Baptiste (m. Marie Francoise Lauzon), Guillaume (m. Genevieve Lanthier) Jacques Philippe (lived 14 days), Augustin (lived 5 months), Louis (lived 2 months), Genevieve born 
2 CONC 1773 (lived 23 days).
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie Louise died on June 4, 1817 and was buried on June 7 in St. Benoit. Joachim died on March 31, 1811 and was buried in St. Benoit on April 2nd.
