3 NOTE Thanks. Marguerite Descomps dit Labadie is my 4th great grandmother.  I've been working on her line today.  Her mother was Marie Francoise Robert was the daughter of Anthoine Robert and Marie Louisa Becquemont.  I had to disconnec
4 CONC t a relationship somewhere in this line though because it was causing the relationship of my sixth great grandparents, to that of brother of 7th great uncle.  These families are all intertwined and Geni doesn't seem to know how to
