2 CONT Eliza Ouellet was born on 9 Mar 1833 in Saint-Basile, Madawaska, New Brunswick. She was the daughter of Joseph Ouellet and his wife Marie Luce Thibodeau. Eliza married Antoine Larabel in 1856. The family was living in Michigan by 
2 CONC the time of the 1870 US Census. Eliza died 27 Dec 1882 in Berlin, Monroe, Michigan.
