1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Note: Married Pierre Henaut dit Delorme, not his brother Pierre Henaut dit Freniere (similar names and birthdays)
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LTG3-786
2 CONT Brief Life History of Marguerite'''''''''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marguerite Piette was born about 1702, in Quebec, Canada, her father, Antoine Piette Lafreniere Trempe, was 30 and her mother, Marie-Thérèse Charron, was 29. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Pierre Henaut dit DELORME (1691-1756) on 18 June 1720, in Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 6 sons and 5 daughters. 
2 CONT Marie Madeleine Hénault dit Delorme 1721–1751
2 CONT Jean-Baptiste Hénault 1722–1755
2 CONT Joseph Hénault dit Delorme 1724–1786
2 CONT Jean Baptiste Henault Delorme 1726–1819
2 CONT Catherine Marie Francoise Henault dit Delorme 1727–1788
2 CONT Geneviève Hénault Delorme 1727–1803
2 CONT Simon-Pierre Hénault Delorme 1730–1762
2 CONT Marie Françoise Hénault 1733–1788
2 CONT Marie Angélique Hénault dit Delorme 1733–1818
2 CONT François Henault 1735–1760
2 CONT Ovide Henault dit Delorme 1737–1755
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 3 January 1757, in Berthierville, Berthier, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 56, and was buried in Berthierville, Berthier, Quebec, Canada.
2 CONT
