1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/GMRD-NWN
2 CONT Brief Life History of Jean Baptiste'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Jean Baptiste Henault dit Delorme dit Portneuf was born on 2 February 1726, in Pierre-De Saurel, Quebec, Canada, his father, Pierre Henault dit Delorme, was 34 and his mother, Marguerite Piette, was 25. 
2 CONT [Note he had an older brother also named Jean-Baptiste; this brother is denoteed by the "dit Portneuf"]
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie Josephe GÉNÉREUX on 9 December 1760, in Saint-Antoine-de-Lavaltrie, Berthier, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 7 sons and 4 daughters. 
2 CONT Joseph Ambroise Henault dit Portneuf 1761–1831
2 CONT Jean-Baptiste Héneault dit Porneuf 1763–1839
2 CONT Joseph Ambroise Henault dit Portneuf 1765–1761
2 CONT François Henault dit Portneuf 1766–1847
2 CONT Pierre Henault- Portneuf 1767–
2 CONT Marie Josephe Hénault Portneuf 1769–1814
2 CONT Alexis Henault- Portneuf 1771–1772
2 CONT Marie Genevieve Hénault- Portneuf 1775–
2 CONT Marie Magdeleine Hénault- Portneuf 1777–1777
2 CONT Marie Henault- Portneuf 1778–1778
2 CONT Louis Henault Henault 1780–1781
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 19 September 1819, in Ste-Elisabeth Cemetery, Sainte-Élisabeth, D'Autray, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 93.
2 CONT
2 CONT
