2 CONT Brief Life History of Simon-Pierre'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Simon-Pierre Hénault dit Delorme was born on 9 August 1730, in Berthierville, Berthier, Quebec, Canada, his father, Pierre Henaut dit Delorme, was 38 and his mother, Marguerite Piette, was 29. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married wife Marie Geneviève Charron Ducharme (1741-1810) on 19 February 1759, in Berthierville, Berthier, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 1 son and 3 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 18 October 1762, in Lavaltrie, Berthier, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 32, and was buried in Lavaltrie, Berthier, Quebec, Canada.
