1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Note: Alexis and Charles Boucher are two seperate brothers. Some imported profiles have lumped them together into one profile.
2 CONT Alexis Boucher (1706-1784) married Genevieve Martin dit Pelland.
2 CONT Charles Boucher (1690-1732) married Marie Genevieve Marguerite Henault.
2 CONT Additionally not to be confused with brother Charles who preceded him, and died as infant.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LR8S-DZM
2 CONT Brief Life History of Charles
2 CONT
2 CONT When Charles Boucher was born on December 5 1690 in Chateau Richer, Canada his father , Charles was 32 and his mother Marguerite was 24.  
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie Marguerite Henault (1696-1741) on February 20 1713 in Sorel, Canada. Charles died on November 27 1732 in Berthier-sur-Mer, Canada at the age of 41.
2 CONT They had at least 9 children.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''=== GEDCOM Note ==='''
2 CONT [1307251.ged]    Source St. Boniface College & Library Research Irene Butra
