2 CONT
2 CONT When Pierre Emery dit Coderre was born on 29 January 1671, in Boucherville, Montreal, Canada, New France, his father, Antoine Émery-Coderre, was 27 and his mother, Marie Desnaux, was 23. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie Jeanne Hénault on 30 September 1719. They were the parents of at least 1 son and 1 daughter. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 7 March 1746, in Lanoraie, Berthier, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 75, and was buried in Lanoraie, Berthier, Quebec, Canada.
