1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/KZPV-2CK
2 CONT Brief Life History of Jean Baptiste'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Jean Baptiste Boyer Lafantaisie was born about 1681, in Fauguerolles, Lot-et-Garonne, France. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He 1st wife married Jeanne de Guire (1683-1723) on 23 September 1708, in Montreal, Quebec, Canada. 
2 CONT No children on record.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married 2nd wife Marie Louise Hénault dite Énaud (1705–1731)
2 CONT on 23 February 1727 in Quebec, Canada
2 CONT They ahd at least 2 daughters and 1 son
