1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/214577339/joseph_bourdeau Find a Grave]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Joseph Bourdeau''' was born about September 1730 to '''Pierre Bourdeau''' 1694-1782 and '''Marie Ann Levitre''' 1699-1763. Joseph died on 5 February 1789 and was buried the next day on the 6th at St. Anne's, Detroit, Michigan T
2 CONC erritory.
2 CONT He married '''Marie Louise Clermont''' on 14 April 1760 at St. Anne's of Detroit, Michigan Territory. They had 17 children and 11 survived to adulthood: 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Joseph, 
2 CONT 2. Jean Baptiste, 
2 CONT 3. Geneveva, 
2 CONT 4. Marie Joseph, 
2 CONT 5. Louis, 
2 CONT 6. Catherine, 
2 CONT 7. Julie Sylvie, 
2 CONT 8. Marie Angelique, 
2 CONT 9. Peter, 
2 CONT 10. Francis Xavier, 
2 CONT 11. Mary Louise. 
2 CONT ----
