2 PLAC St Antoine, Monroe, Michigan
2 ADDR
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} d/o Anthony (Antoine) & Mary Angelica (Peltier) Campeau, bur 7 Feb. 1807. Maiden name also spelled Campau.
2 CONT
2 CONT When Catherine Campeau was born on December 11, 1742, in Detroit, Michigan, her father, Antoine, was 40, and her mother, Marie, was 20. She married Jean Baptiste Couture on October 25, 1762, in her hometown. They had ten children 
2 CONC in 23 years. She died on February 7, 1807, in Wayne, Michigan, at the age of 64, and was buried in Monroe, Michigan.
2 CONT
