1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Antoine TREMBLAY was born on 4 Aug 1698 in Petite Riviere, P. Q.. He was baptized on 5 Aug 1698 in Baie St. Paul, Charlevoix, P. Q.. He died in Feb 1758 in P. Q.. He was buried on 12 Feb 1758 in P. Q.. Antoine Trem
2 CONC blay and Marie-Anne Pilote had at least 3 children. They were: Marguerite, Marie-Madeleine and Michel. MICHEL relates to this genealogy. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents: MICHEL TREMBLAY and GENEVIEVE BOUCHARD.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was married to Marie-Anne PILOTE on 25 May 1724 in Marriage contract by Notaire: Dubreuil. (P. Q.). Children were: Marguerite TREMBLAY, Marie-Therese TREMBLAY , Michel TREMBLAY, Antoine TREMBLAY, Marie-Catherine TREMBLAY , Etie
