1 NAME Pierre /Dufour dit Bonvivant/
2 GIVN Pierre
2 SURN Dufour dit Bonvivant
2 _MARNM Dufour dit Bonvivant
2 NICK Pierre Dufour
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 ADDR
3 STAE Montréal
3 CTRY Quebec
1 BAPM
2 DATE 14 JUN 1711
2 PLAC Notre-dame
2 ADDR
1 BIRT
2 DATE 14 JUN 1711
2 PLAC Notre Dame St Malo, , Bretagne Province, France
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 14 NOV 1766
2 ADDR
3 CITY Assumption Church
3 STAE Ontario
3 CTRY Canada
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Pierre came to Detroit 1739 as a soldier.  The Dufour family lived on the South Shore of Detroit (Sandwich) but religious events were performed at St. Anne's Church on the North Shore (Detroit). The family later se
2 CONC ttled on the South Coast of Detroit in the parish of Assumption Sandwich.  Assumption Church was a mission for the Indians on the South Shore from 1728 to about 1765. The family then began attending mass at Assumption Church.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT http://www.fichierorigine.com/app/recherche/detail.php?numero=241363
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Pierre Dufourd [Dufour] “was living at Détroit with a large family composed of five boys, two girls and their mother. He was given land on the South Shore by l’Isle aux Dindes. He was considered a habitant or domiciled at Détroit.
2 CONC  The family was given 5-½ rations from 1 September 1750 to 1 March 1752.” Pierre Dufour dit Bonvivant, an anspessade (lance corporal) in the Company of M. Denoyan, from the parish of Notre-Dame in StMalo, married Charlotte Gloria 
2 CONC on 17 June 1737 at Montréal. Based on PRDH, they were the parents of three sons: Pierre, Joachim, Louis and three daughters: Marie Charlotte, Catherine and Marie Louise Brigitte.
2 CONT  Two additional sons born in Detroit were Jean Baptiste Mathieu and Charles Dufourd is listed in the September 1750 census with 9 people, including him, in the household.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://habitantheritage.org/yahoo_site_admin/assets/docs/Cicotte_papers_for_website.108125445.pdf http://www.fichierorigine.com/app/recherche/detail.php?numero=241363
