1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LCSR-QXF
2 CONT Brief Life History of Madeleine'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marie Madeleine Pilon was born on 27 February 1718, in Pointe-Claire, Montreal, Quebec, Canada, her father, Jean Pilon, was 26 and her mother, Marie-Anne Gervais, was 25. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Olivier Perrin dit Garault on 28 July 1738, in Sainte-Anne-de-Varennes, Montreal, Canada, New France. They were the parents of at least 6 sons and 3 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 26 October 1774, in Sainte-Geneviève, Jacques-Cartier, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 56, and was buried in Sainte-Geneviève, Jacques-Cartier, Quebec, Canada.
