1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Delina Drouillard was born on 15 Jan 1856 in Trenton, Michigan to John Baptiste Drouillard and Adeline Autin. After Delina was born, the family moved back to River Canard, Essex Co., Ontario, Canada.
2 CONT
2 CONT Delina married Louis Pattenaude on 23 May 1870 at St. Joseph's Church in River Canard. Delina and Louis had twelve children: Albert, Calixte, Fredrick, Thercile, Marie, Alice, Louis, Paul, Felix, Ernest, Clement, and George. The f
2 CONC amily lived at 19 Riopelle St., Ecorse, Michigan.
2 CONT
2 CONT Delina died at her home on 533 N. 6th St. in Wyandotte, Michigan of apoplexy. Mass was held at Our Lady of Lourdes in River Rouge, Michigan. She was buried at Holy Cross Cemetery in Detroit, Michigan.
2 CONT
