1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/G67F-J8N
2 CONT Brief Life History of Mary'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Mary Girard was born in 1853, in Ontario, Canada, her father, Toussaint Girard, was 28 and her mother, Angélique Lucier, was 25. She had at least 3 sons and 2 daughters with Israel Joseph Splitlog. 
2 CONT John W Splitlog 1874–
2 CONT Julia Edith Splitlog 1875–
2 CONT Mary Ellen Splitlog 1877–1882
2 CONT Douglas A Splitlog 1880–1969
2 CONT Radolph Splitlog 1883–1942
2 CONT
2 CONT She lived in Anderdon Township, Essex, Ontario, Canada in 1881 and Essex, Ontario, Canada for about 10 years.
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in Michigan, United States in 1930.
