1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LQ5T-FXM
2 CONT Brief Life History of Pierre'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Pierre Lauzon was born on 19 July 1772, in Saint-Eustache, Deux-Montagnes, Quebec, Canada, his father, Jean Baptiste Lauzon, was 34 and his mother, Marie Josephte Cadieux, was 28. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marguerite Lefebvre on 26 September 1803, in Châteauguay, Châteauguay, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 1 son and 4 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 21 April 1810, in Les Cèdres, Vaudreuil-Soulanges, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 37.
