1 NOTE {geni:about_me} I believe this to be the parent of Sarah Roe, my great-great grandmother, as I was looking in the census for the time period and in the area during the time Sarah Roe was living.  This was the only family I found w
2 CONC ith the spelling of Reau and Roe.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Our Sarah Roe was French, and R-O-E is not a French-spelling, making me believe her father who was a REAU had changed their spelling at some point, since he was listed two different ways Roe and Reau.  
2 CONT
2 CONT I'm 99% positive this is the parent of Sarah Roe, grandma Lenore Barron's grandmother.  I have attached the census records.
